Bonus Action; Concentration, up to 1 minute. Create a blade-shaped planar rift; when cast and on later turns as a Bonus Action, make up to two melee spell attacks against targets within 5 ft. of the blade. Each attack: +24 to hit, 4d12 Force damage; critical on 18–20, dealing 12d12 Force damage. On later turns the blade can move up to 30 ft. before attacking and can pass harmlessly through barriers.

